[{"id":"forumshare_1783790681709_mulg","sender":"me","text":"[萨加拉树根留言板] 衣服上长出了叶子怎么办在线等急","forumShareData":{"title":"衣服上长出了叶子怎么办在线等急","preview":"崩溃了家人们……今天洗完衣服晾在院子里，刚好一头犀牛杜鹃龙路过，它打了个巨大的喷嚏！现在我所有的亚麻衬衫不仅全是一股浓烈的花粉味，袖口甚至长出了粉色的小嫩芽！！这还能穿吗？拔掉会不会破坏衣服啊？","boardTag":"萨加拉树根留言板","author":"匿名","stats":"❤️19  💬8","postId":1783790326903,"isOwnPost":false,"isAnon":true,"isAuthoredByChar":false},"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:24:41.709Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2086},{"id":1783796691737,"sender":"me","text":"大家看","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:24:47.771Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2087},{"id":1783796691738,"sender":"me","text":"我最近看的论坛","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:24:53.717Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2088},{"id":1783796691739,"sender":"me","text":"都是些魔药植物相关的事情～","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:03.966Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2089},{"id":1783796691740,"sender":"me","text":"很好玩吧！","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:08.176Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2090},{"id":1783796691741,"sender":"me","text":"大家来聊聊天","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:12.521Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2091},{"id":1783796691742,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"看到第二个水下呼吸的帖子了。那位学士的想法实在太大胆，暗流海绵剥夺空气呼吸能力的特质极具排他性，强行混合很可能导致在水面和水下都窒息的惨剧。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:53.764Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2092},{"id":1783796691743,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"那个“医生苹果”也太危险了……吃完24小时内免疫一切治疗效果，万一受了伤怎么办？亲爱的千万不要碰那种东西。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:56.496Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2093},{"id":1783796691744,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"那个长出粉色小嫩芽的亚麻衬衫！感觉会很好吃！亚麻的纤维加上花粉的甜味，口感一定很丰富！","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:58.087Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2094},{"id":1783796691745,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"@乔鲁纳 衬衫是绝对不能吃的，哪怕上面长了叶子。纺织品在胃里会造成严重的肠道堵塞。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:59.776Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2095},{"id":1783796691746,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"可是我是海兔呀！我的胃袋连毒药和石头都能融化，区区一件衬衫算什么！","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:02.613Z","replyTo":{"id":1783796691745,"text":"@乔鲁纳 衬衫是绝对不能吃的，哪怕上面长了叶子。纺织品在胃里会造成严重的肠道堵塞。","sender":"them","senderName":"莱昂德尔"},"roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2096,"deleted":true},{"id":1783796691747,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"其实长出叶子的衣服挺适合森林伪装的。不过我对那个雷颚龙的黏液比较感兴趣，如果混入我刚才弄的毒泥，做出的陷阱应该很厉害。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:05.381Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2097},{"id":1783796691748,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"亲爱的需要我去接那个悬赏吗？那个位移李听起来挺好玩的，可以给您拿来当防身道具。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:08.231Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2098},{"id":1783796691749,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"第一条的魔法蜂蜜听起来很棒，带有愈合和安神效果的话，加进松饼里给亲爱的当下午茶就太好了……我可以用自己种的草药去换。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:12.944Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2099},{"id":1783796691750,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"@乔鲁纳 你快到厨房来吧，我给你留了一大盘松饼边角料，刚淋上枫糖，不要去想吃衣服的事了……","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:15.719Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","reactions":["🤤"],"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2100},{"id":1783796691751,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"！！！我马上到！！！枫糖松饼我来了！！！","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:18.045Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2101},{"id":1783796691752,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"那我就把红茶彻底泡开了。温室这边的阳光刚刚好，亲爱的，你随时可以带着书过来。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:20.795Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2102},{"id":1783796691753,"sender":"them","text":"亲爱的……如果您喜欢长出叶子的衣服，我可以用变形咒给我的睡衣也变一点出来……只要您觉得好玩，想怎么撕都可以的……","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:23.920Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1783089244415","groupName":"草药温室植物交流群","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2103},{"id":1783796691754,"sender":"them","text":"那个医生苹果，如果您需要用来对付什么坏人的话，我可以悄悄去帮您弄来，不会让任何人发现的。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:27.031Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1783089244415","groupName":"草药温室植物交流群","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","_id":2104},{"id":1783787690093,"text":"哈哈没有！只是觉得很好玩","sender